# project: podcast-season-one
VAR episodes_banked = 0
VAR re_edits = 0

-> record_pilot

=== record_pilot ===
Record the pilot episode to prove out the show format.
+ [Pilot cut ready for review] -> pilot_review

=== pilot_review ===
Comms director reviews the pilot and rules on whether the format works.
* [Format works, start booking guests] @human -> book_guests
+ [Retool the format and re-record] @human ~loop~ -> record_pilot

=== book_guests ===
Maintain a rolling pipeline of confirmed guests for the season.
+ [Guest dropped out, book the next one] ~loop~ -> book_guests
+ [Enough guests confirmed for a batch] -> batch_production

=== batch_production ===
Record and edit episodes in batches with the confirmed guests.
~ re_edits = 0
+ [Batch recorded and edited] -> guest_approval

=== guest_approval ===
The guest reviews the final cut of their episode before it can be scheduled.
+ [Guest approves the final cut] @human -> sponsor_reads
+ {re_edits < 1} [Guest requests their one re-edit] @human -> re_edit

=== re_edit ===
Apply the guest's requested changes; each guest gets one re-edit.
~ re_edits += 1
+ [Deliver the revised cut] ~loop~ -> guest_approval

=== sponsor_reads ===
Sponsor reviews and approves the sponsor reads before insertion.
+ [Sponsor approves the reads] @human -> bank_check
+ [Sponsor requests changes] @human ~loop~ -> sponsor_reads

=== bank_check ===
Bank the approved episode and check progress toward the launch threshold.
~ episodes_banked += 1
* {episodes_banked >= 6} [Six episodes banked, launch] -> launch
+ {episodes_banked < 6} [Keep producing] ~loop~ -> book_guests
+ [Quarter ending short of six] -> shortfall_decision

=== shortfall_decision ===
Comms director decides how to handle a quarter-end shortfall.
* [Launch with four episodes] @human -> launch
+ [Push to next quarter, keep banking] @human ~loop~ -> book_guests

=== launch ===
Launch season one of the podcast.
-> END
